# Cargo build output
/target/

# Release packaging output (scripts/package-release.sh)
/dist/

# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC debug symbols generated by rustc
*.pdb

# Coverage and profiling output
*.profraw
*.profdata
.tarpaulin-cache/
coverage/

# Editor and OS cruft. Nothing here is ever part of a change, and on macOS
# `.DS_Store` in particular appears in any directory the Finder has visited.
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log

# Local agent state: per-machine permission allow-lists and scratch worktrees.
# Deliberately narrow patterns rather than ignoring `.claude/` wholesale, so a
# shared, checked-in `.claude/settings.json` remains possible; there is no such
# file today.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.qoder/

# Credential-bearing local config. These are files this CLI itself reads from or
# writes to the working directory, so they show up here during ordinary use and
# would otherwise be one `git add -A` away from being published: `.mcp.json`
# carries per-server `env` blocks (API keys for MCP servers), `.credentials.json`
# is the OAuth token store, and a `.env` is the usual place a provider key ends
# up. Ignored rather than trusted to reviewer attention.
.mcp.json
.credentials.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
